amespace* property set and vSphere IaaS Control Plane   Virtual Machines. - &#x60;VSPHERE_POD&#x60;: The folder containing vSphere Pods.      It is a child of namespace associated folder, i.e., folder with   *Folder.namespace* property set and may contain vSphere Pods.  ***Since:*** vSphere API Release 9.0.0.0 
